00S-P models.", "The filtration system is described as 3-stage H13 grade True HEPA, designed to capture fine particulate matter.", "Consumers can choose between official Levoit filters and third-party replacements, with the latter often available in cost-effective multi-packs like 2-packs."]', 'published') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
