ird-party replacements, with some listings indicating multi-pack configurations for value."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'dyson'), 'DC59', 'dyson-dc59-replacement-filter', 'vacuum', 'replacement filter for dyson dc59', '965661-01', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Verify the exact model number and part code on your Dyson DC59 before ordering, as some listings also cover V6, V7, V8 and DC58 variants which may use different filters.', '[{"q": "What part number should I look for when buying a replacement pre‑filter for a Dyson DC59?", "a": "The official Dyson pre‑filter part number is 965661‑01, and any compatible third‑party filter will list this code or state compatibility with DC59."}, {"q": "Are OEM Dyson filters better than third‑party replacements for the DC59?", "a": "OEM filters are made by Dyson and guarantee the exact specifications, while third‑party packs offer lower cost and multi‑pack quantities but may lack official certification."}, {"q": "Do the listed replacement filters provide HEPA filtration for the DC59?", "a": "None of the titles specify a HEPA grade; they are described as pre‑filters or generic replacement filters without explicit HEPA performance details."}]', 'Replacement filters for the Dyson DC59 are compatible with part number 965661‑01 and fit the pre‑filter slot. While Dyson’s OEM filter uses this official code, numerous third‑party multi‑pack options are also sold, offering the same basic filtration without a specified HEPA grade or performance claim.', '["The pre‑filter for Dyson DC59 matches part 965661‑01 and is listed across all compatible third‑party packs.", "Listings show compatibility with multiple Dyson models (V6, V7, V8, DC58, DC59) but do not specify HEPA grade or exact dimensions.", "Buyers can choose genuine OEM filters or value‑packed third‑party replacements, though third‑party parts may lack official certification."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
